<title>ROMANIA: TENNIS-ROMANIA OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ROMANIA OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results in the Romanian Open men's tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Christian Ruud (Norway) beat Thomas Johansson (Sweden) 6-4 6-1</p>
<p>8-Jiri Novak (Czech Republic) beat Lionel Roux (France) 6-4 7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Andrei Pavel (Romania) beat Johan van Herk (Belgium) 6-2 6-2  </p>
<p>Dinu Pescariu (Romania) beat 7-Gilbert Schaller (Austria) 4-6 6-4 6-2.</p>
</text>
